- Count in bases (from $1_"10" "to" 30_"10"$)
  + 6
  + 9
  + 4

- Convert from Bin to Dec
  + Convert $1101_2$ to decimal.
  + Convert $10111_2$ to decimal.

- Convert from Dec to Bin
  + Convert $52_"10"$ to binary.
  + Convert $256_"10"$ to binary.

- Convert from Hex to Dec
  + Convert $2"B"_16$ to decimal.
  + Convert $"A.C"_16$ to decimal.

- Convert from Dec to Hex
  + Convert $127_"10"$ to hexadecimal.
  + Convert $2048_"10"$ to hexadecimal.

- Convert from Hex to Bin
  + Convert $"F"7_16$ to binary.
  + Convert $8"D"_16$ to binary.

- Convert from Bin to Hex
  + Convert $10111101_2$ to hexadecimal.
  + Convert $1110110_2$ to hexadecimal.

- Convert from any Base to any Base
  + Convert $121_3$ to base 6.
  + Convert $35_8$ to base 5.

- Most and Least Significant Digits
  + Identify the MSB and LSB of $(1011010)_2$.
  + Identify the MSD and LSD of $(4"B"9)_16$.

- Floating Point Representation
  + Represent $14.75_"10"$ in single-precision IEEE 754.
  + Represent $-0.8125_"10"$ in single-precision IEEE 754.
  + Convert the IEEE 754 value `0xC1200000` to decimal.
  + Convert the IEEE 754 value `0x41100000` to decimal.

