  + Represent $110.01_2$ in IEEE 754 single precision.
  + Represent $-0.111_2$ in IEEE 754 single precision.

- Convert from Bin to 2's Complement
  + Find the 8-bit 2's complement of $110110_2$.
  + Find the 8-bit 2's complement of $-24_"10"$.

- Convert from any Base to IEEE 754
  + Convert $(15.25)_10$ to IEEE 754 single precision.
  + Convert $("C".4)_16$ to IEEE 754 single precision.

- Convert from any Base to 2's Complement
